                    <div class="element-text">Science Fiction Club&#039;s &quot;Golana&quot; Is Scheduled For Issue This Month by Gil Wachsman<br />
<br />
Golana, the student science fiction magazine, will again appear on campus. Published under the auspices of the Poly Science Fiction Club, it will feature four poems, special features, and eight short stories, ranging in length from two to seven pages. It will be issued to the student body sometime in the next two weeks.<br />
<br />
